---
// Vergleichstabelle: warum ScriptZ und nicht Notion / Final Draft / Apple Notes.
---

<section class="cmp section-tight" id="vergleich">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cmp-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">ScriptZ vs. der Rest</span>
      <h2 class="h-section">
        Wir haben die Tabelle ausgefüllt,<br />
        <span class="cmp-head-em">die du sonst selbst zusammensuchen müsstest.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead cmp-lead">
        Die meisten Programme machen entweder zu viel oder zu wenig.
        ScriptZ ist genau das Werkzeug für kurze Skripte, das wir
        selbst gebraucht haben.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cmp-table reveal">
      <div class="cmp-row cmp-head-row" role="rowheader">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell cmp-self">
          <img src="/img/icon.png" alt="" width="22" height="22" />
          <span>ScriptZ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell">Notion</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell">Final Draft</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell">Apple Notes</div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Startet in unter einer Sekunde</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes" aria-label="Ja">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no" aria-label="Nein">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no" aria-label="Nein">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes" aria-label="Ja">✓</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Funktioniert komplett offline</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-warn" aria-label="Eingeschränkt">~</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Ohne Konto, ohne Login</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-warn">~</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Charaktere mit eigener Farbe</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Eigene Block-Typen für Skripte</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Auf kurze Skripte zugeschnitten</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Versionsverlauf pro Skript</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Alles bleibt auf deinem Gerät</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-warn">~</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-warn">~</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Kostenlos, ohne Sternchen</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-warn">~</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell-feat">Quellcode öffentlich</div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-yes">✓</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-cell"><span class="ic ic-no">−</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="cmp-footnote">
      Notion und Google Docs sind super Tools, aber für Datenbanken
      und Textdokumente, nicht für Skripte. Final Draft und Celtx
      sind großartig, wenn du am 110-seitigen Spielfilm sitzt.
      ScriptZ füllt die Lücke dazwischen.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cmp-head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-9);
  }
  .cmp-head-em {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .cmp-lead {
    margin: var(--sp-4) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cmp-table {
    background: var(--bg-elev-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--r-5);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cmp-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 1.6fr) repeat(4, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cmp-row + .cmp-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cmp-row:nth-child(even) {
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.015);
  }

  .cmp-head-row {
    background: var(--bg-elev-2) !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--fs-14);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .cmp-cell-feat,
  .cmp-cell {
    padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5);
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-14);
  }
  .cmp-cell-feat {
    text-align: left;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .cmp-self {
    color: var(--fg);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .cmp-self img { border-radius: 5px; }

  .cmp-table .cmp-row > .cmp-cell:nth-child(2),
  .cmp-table .cmp-row > .cmp-self {
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.04);
  }

  .ic {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .ic-yes {
    background: rgba(79, 154, 108, 0.15);
    color: #2f7050;
  }
  .ic-no {
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.06);
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }
  .ic-warn {
    background: rgba(200, 123, 0, 0.15);
    color: #8a5400;
  }

  .cmp-footnote {
    margin-top: var(--sp-5);
    font-size: var(--fs-13);
    color: var(--fg-subtle);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cmp-table { overflow-x: auto; }
    .cmp-row { min-width: 640px; }
    .cmp-cell-feat, .cmp-cell {
      padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4);
      font-size: var(--fs-13);
    }
  }
</style>
